WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.660
I've got another spot
the difference challenge for

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:06.980
you with some pictures that I took
on my most recent trip to Paris.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.770
Both of these images pretty
much look the same, but

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.660
can you spot the difference?

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.490
Once again, DevTools are definitely
going to help you out.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:17.850
You can find a link to that
site in the instructor notes.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.750
What's the difference between them?

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.430
Is it their compression level,
their display size,

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.180
their natural size, or their type?

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.080
Check all that apply.

